B.Mv=new A.y("Old Turtle","An old turtle comes by. It has traveled all the oceans!","The old have many stories \u2014 listen carefully.",B.O)
B.Nq=new A.y("Baby Turtles","Tiny baby turtles hatch. They must reach the sea.","Do not block them \u2014 let them go home.",B.p)
B.NU=new A.y("Fisherman Pak Eko","Pak Eko is an old fisherman. He tells of the sea long ago.","Respect elders and those who work hard for their family.",B.O)
B.Ol=new A.y("Fish Market","At the fish market, everyone is honest about prices. Kiko learns.","Honest trade makes buyers trust you.",B.ar)
B.Of=new A.y("Dolphins","Dolphins leap in the sea! They are very smart.","Smart and still kind \u2014 that is true smart.",B.p)
